OL,3,GFEATURESC40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe BBC is normally pretty good at
OL,7,Fmarking anniversaries. 40 years of
OL,8,Fbreakfast TV, 60 years of Doctor Who,
OL,9,F100 years of the BBC itself. But this
OL,10,Fweekend marks a different anniversary.
OL,12,FThe early evening magazine programme
OL,13,FNationwide came to an end on 5th August
OL,14,F1983.
OL,16,FFor such a successful programme, its
OL,17,Fend was unbecoming.
OL,23,APub: 06-Aug-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
