OL,3,GFEATURESC40 years since the final
OL,4,Cedition of Nationwide
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom power cuts, the Three Day Week and
OL,7,Fpolitical turmoil to spacehoppers,
OL,8,Fskateboarding ducks and passing
OL,9,Fcelebrities.
OL,11,FWhen The One Show launched in 2006 it
OL,12,Fwas sometimes described as a successor
OL,13,Fto Nationwide but I would argue the
OL,14,Fcomparison is misleading.
OL,16,FDespite some good popular current
OL,17,Faffairs films, The One Show is not
OL,18,Frooted in news and the events of the
OL,19,Fday.
OL,23,APub: 06-Aug-2023Qpppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext Page BRewind CNat Radio FNat Sport
FL,200,120,200,300,0,100
